n...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zj4-xYn3lsIQ7kNvwHVTc-S&_nc_oc=AdpQW7PAc59JUwiDzAHncqWzC79RMjsbsDg0MfgU41CM4bdNWWc_ifnxZnFXZIhirkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9m-2L93H18PJ0apgYRCIy3_jSvWpU3G-LQdSfhiOcVpw&oe=6A36BF87"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=63Syabkzi3QQ7kNvwHduVtT&_nc_oc=Adqrg2t7xTbhDpd3UcPRttyNLCHqK2DuKbUoFMK3GzEilLbU2CxZTCtXmyuM1a-ydgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9fBf-OBSAD5X30Y_8llrosxyDbC3OBLkKMyTcHBdZXKQ&oe=6A3694FC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LmpxvxL4RHkQ7kNvwGCo35h&_nc_oc=AdrWryv46LmAAvtgZIdHWZwvfiv-iw6pj7OdzSqLzmOxMoxzZwquGtr_vIp73qDQLKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-rbel6zR7ZKnokngfcRdunJy1nyRjUasrauQHQPxH9lQ&oe=6A36BE6B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_446